# TD Games Invoice Generator V2 Refactor - Walkthrough

This document outlines the successful refactoring of the TD Games Invoice Generator application into its V2 version. The refactor successfully migrated the backend to NocoDB and replaced the UI with a premium, modern design using Stitch MCP.

## Changes Made

### 1. NocoDB Backend Integration
- **New Workspace:** Created a dedicated set of tables in the `TD_Games` NocoDB base to store invoice data without conflicting with existing tables.
- **Tables Created:**
    - `v2_Invoice_Clients`: Stores client contact information.
    - `v2_Invoices`: Core invoice details (number, date, status, currency).
    - `v2_Invoice_Items`: Line items linked to invoices via Foreign Keys.
    - `v2_Bank_Profiles`: Reusable banking configurations.
- **Service Layer:** Implemented [services/nocodbService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-generator/services/nocodbService.ts) using Axios for secure and structured API communication with NocoDB.

### 2. UI Redesign (Stitch MCP)
- **Dashboard:** A high-fidelity dashboard with glassmorphism, dark mode, and real-time statistics.
- **Invoice Editor:** A split-screen editor providing a side-by-side view of the input form and a live-updating invoice preview.
- **Branding:** Consistent "TD Games - Premium Billing Engine" branding applied throughout the app.

### 3. Frontend Architecture
- **App.tsx Refactor:** Simplified the main entry point to manage routing between the Dashboard and Editor.
- **Componentized Styles:** Isolated styles into [DashboardV2.css](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-generator/components/DashboardV2.css) and [InvoiceEditorV2.css](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-generator/components/InvoiceEditorV2.css) for better maintainability.
- **Export System:** Integrated existing HTML-to-PDF/PNG export functionality into the new Editor interface.

